{
  "description": "a rounded slot (6 long, 2 wide, ends of radius 1) with its long axis in the xz plane, carried along a planar cubic (0,0,0), (0,0,15), (15,0,25), (30,0,25) turning a quarter under the rotation-minimising law: faces are fitted, the profile is centred on the path so the volume is area times arc length; the cubic's radius of curvature stays over the slot's reach of 3 (ADR-0063)",
